    "playingGuide": "<h1 style=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><u style=\"\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\">1.&nbsp;</span></font></u></b><font face=\"Impact\"><b style=\"\"><u style=\"\">HOW TO REGISTER:</u></b></font></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" style=\"\" color=\"#ffc69c\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">- Fill Your Phone Number</span></font></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">- Set Your Own Password ( 6 letters ）</span><br></font></span></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\">- Confirm The Password</font></span></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\">- Fill Your Recommendation Code</font></span></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">- Click I Have Read And Agree</span><br></font></span></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\">- Click Register</font></span></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911171530r1y6.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><br></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></p><h1 style=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" color=\"#104a5a\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\"><b style=\"\"><u style=\"\">2.&nbsp;</u></b></span></font><font color=\"#104a5a\" face=\"Impact\"><b><u>HOW TO BETTING:</u></b></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Click start game then choose 1 minute, 3 minute, 5 minute or 10 minute.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Green&nbsp; : if the result shows 1,3,7,9</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Red&nbsp; &nbsp; : if the result shows 2,4,6,8</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Violet&nbsp; : if the result shows 0 or 5</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Small&nbsp; : if the result shows 0,1,2,3,4</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Big&nbsp; &nbsp; : if the result shows 5,6,7,8,9</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">This company not allowed to place Illegal betting</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Exp ：Betting (Big and small together) or (Red and Green together) in the same time.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911172244xtjj.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><br></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></p><h2 style=\"\"><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></h2><h1 style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\"><b><u>3. </u></b></span></font><font color=\"#104a5a\" face=\"Impact\"><b><u>HOW TO RECHARGE:</u></b></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">。Click ACCOUNT, Click DEPOSIT, and we have SIX ways to make a recharge.</font></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911173506usbd.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_202609111735394oc5.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></p><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><b><u><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\">4. </span></font></u></b><font face=\"Impact\"><b><u>HOW TO WITHDRAW:</u></b></font></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Click ACCOUNT, Click WITHDRAW.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Enter withdraw amount</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Make Sure Your Total Bet Until Zero</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Select Your Bank Account Or Add Your Bank Account</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Input Amount You Want To Withdraw</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Input Your Login Password<br></font></h2><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911174834tk5x.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911174839lssw.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><br></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></p><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><b><u><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\">5. ORDERS</span></font></u></b><font face=\"Impact\"><b><u>:</u></b></font></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">---&gt; When The Betting Complete You Can Click My Game History To My History, You Can Check The Chart .<br></font><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911180505ntt6.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\"><br></font></h2><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><b><u><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\"><br>6. PROMOTION</span></font></u></b><font face=\"Impact\"><b><u>:</u></b></font></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- If you have a downline or referral member use your own link to register and if they make a recharge you can claim a reward. The agent will get a minimum commission of 0.6 % (level 1) and 0.18% (level 2) from each transaction that is done by the referral (Added every day at 00:30 AM.) If the accumulated transactions of the Referral reach a certain target, the agent will get an additional bonus with the following rebates.<br>- You Can Click The Sharing Invitation Poster To See The Barcode.<br><br></font><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911175625va12.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_202609111756328ty3.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\"><br></font></h2><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><b><u><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\"><br>7. ACCOUNT SECURITY</span></font></u></b><font face=\"Impact\"><b><u>:</u></b></font></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">Go To ACCOUNT, Click Setting Icon.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Click Login Password.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Re-Enter Your Login Password.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Enter Strongest New Password, and Confirm Your Password.</font></h2><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\">- Click Save Changes.<br></font><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_20260911180231febh.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><img src=\"https://ossimg.dmfirst9acting.com/dmfirst/editor/editor_202609111802437j9x.png\" style=\"width: 50%;\"><font color=\"#ffc69c\" face=\"Arial Black\"><br></font></h2><h1 style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><font color=\"#104a5a\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\"><b><u><br>8. FORGOT PASSWORD</u></b></span></font><font color=\"#104a5a\" face=\"Impact\"><b><u>:</u></b></font></span></h1><h2 style=\"\"><font color=\"#f